Focus Areas: Web Security, Threat Exposure Reduction, Detection, Remediation, Validation

This project demonstrates hands-on experience in external attack surface reduction, web security hardening, 
threat intelligence utilization, and security validation. Remediation activities were conducted
from August 5 to September 5, 2025, resulting in a measurable improvement in the organization’s external cyber risk rating from C to A, 
thereby validating the effectiveness of the implemented remediation actions.
